<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/hero-women.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">About us</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Our Story</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub reveal">Curated luxury journeys through East Africa, designed for women.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="article">
        <nav class="breadcrumb reveal"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / About us</nav>

        <p class="article__lead reveal">Rendile Travels was born from a simple belief — that women deserve to experience the wild heart of East Africa on their own terms: safely, beautifully and entirely on their own pace. We design tailor-made journeys through Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda and Rwanda for women who want the magic without the guesswork.</p>

        <h2 class="reveal">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="reveal">We are a boutique, women-focused travel company specialising in East Africa. Our name nods to the <strong>Rendille</strong> people of northern Kenya — pastoralists known for their resilience, their craftsmanship and their deep connection to the land. That spirit guides how we travel: with respect, with care, and with an eye for the genuinely special. Every itinerary is built by hand, never pulled off a shelf.</p>

        <h2 class="reveal">Why we travel women-first</h2>
        <p class="reveal">Travelling as a woman — solo, with friends, as mothers and daughters, or as a sisterhood — has its own joys and its own considerations. We build for them. That means vetted, welcoming camps, female guides wherever possible, sociable hosted departures for solo travellers, and a Rendile team reachable around the clock. The result is freedom: to wander, to rest, to connect, and to feel completely looked after.</p>

        <h2 class="reveal">How we travel</h2>
        <p class="reveal">We are not a booking engine. Each journey is shaped around you by a designer who knows these countries intimately — your pace, your interests, the way you like to feel at the end of a long, wonderful day. We hand-pick the camps and lodges, arrange every transfer door to door, and stay one step ahead so you never have to. Luxury, to us, is the absence of friction — and the presence of the extraordinary.</p>

        <h2 class="reveal" id="community">Our community</h2>
        <p class="reveal">Travel should give back to the places and people that make it possible. We partner with camps and operators who employ and uplift local communities, favour women-led cooperatives for the crafts, coffee and experiences we include, and support the conservation efforts — from gorilla protection to rewilded savannas — that keep East Africa wild. When you travel with us, a meaningful share of your journey stays in the communities you visit.</p>

        <div class="article__cta reveal">
          <h3>Let's plan your East Africa journey.</h3>
          <p>Tell us how you like to travel and your designer will craft something around you — no pressure, no obligation.</p>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn--gold">Start planning</a>
        </div>

        <h2 class="reveal">Explore our destinations</h2>
